{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rtrrfRL9g61794201623.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台今早錄得氣溫23.2度，是入秋以來最低，預測晚上市區氣溫進一步下降，明早最低約16度。</p><p></p><p>天氣轉涼，秋風陣陣，不少人上班上學都穿上長袖衫及外套保暖。早上7時40分，天文台錄得23.2度，是今年入秋以來最低。</p><p></p><p>天文台發出特別天氣提示，指受強烈東北季候風影響，預料本港晚上氣溫將進一步下降至最低19度。星期二早上風勢仍然頗大，天氣顯著轉涼，周二早上最低約16度。星期三早上新界仍然清涼，日夜溫差頗大。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.COLD-1300-1_CLEAN_20261109_130258_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FAmtRGkUGT1794201621.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台科學主任黃穎昕說：「正午時分，本港各區氣溫都比昨日低兩至三度。隨著季候風在本周後期緩和，氣溫會逐漸回升。到下周中期，預料另一股東北季候風，會影響廣東沿岸。」</p><p></p><p>天文台預料本港吹偏北強風，市民應提防海面大浪可能帶來的危險，並注意保暖，關顧長者及慢性病患者。</p><p></p><p>預料受高空擾動影響，周末期間華南雲量增多和有幾陣驟雨。周日預測最高28度。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.COLD-1300-1_CLEAN_20261109_130258_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YrR417fhSE1794201618.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.497396+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":375,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T04:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:14.465611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:43.700661+00:00","content_hash":"eeac951e1c10bb77e263033f836096e76c13bbe71def1eb8c935e57ee503183f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.497396+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}